@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180
@apiKey = clicktopay-dev-key
@encryptedPayload = replace-with-five-part-jwe

# Step-by-step test of checkout -> confirmation.
# Without real checkoutWithCard() ids, run the API with MastercardApi:Simulate = true (Development only): neither call
# reaches Mastercard. For an external caller, expose the API (e.g. a Cloudflare tunnel) and change @baseUrl.
# In production the SPI token is generated by the PowerTranz HPP, which sends it to /api/checkout; here any test value
# stands in for it. Use a new @spiToken for every run: a confirmed transaction is not confirmed again (409).
@spiToken = test-spi-0001

### Step 1 - Checkout: writes the row of @spiToken to transactions/ctp_txn_YYYYMMDD.csv (outcome columns empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "spiToken": "{{spiToken}}",
  "srcDpaId": "823ef281-1a2e-4204-a69c-43d355522a35",
  "srcCorrelationId": "<checkoutResponseData.srcCorrelationId>",
  "merchantTransactionId": "<headers[merchant-transaction-id]>",
  "flowId": "<headers[x-src-cx-flow-id]>",
  "transactionAmount": 31.25,
  "transactionCurrencyCode": "USD",
  "xCorrelationId": "7d1f6c2e-9a43-4b8e-b1a2-3f5c8e0d4a17"
}

# Step 2 - Open today's ctp_txn_YYYYMMDD.csv: the row of @spiToken is there, its last ten columns empty.

### Step 3 - Confirmation with the PowerTranz /spi/Payment result: 200, the row gets the outcome and confirmation_result = Confirmed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/confirmations/{{spiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "approved": true,
  "authorizationCode": "123456",
  "responseMessage": "Transaction is approved",
  "networkTransactionIdentifier": "mastercard"
}

### Step 4 - Same SPI token again: 409, nothing sent to Mastercard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/confirmations/{{spiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "approved": true
}

### Step 5 - Declined payment (use a new @spiToken after step 1): checkoutEventStatus and confirmationStatus 02
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/confirmations/{{spiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "approved": false,
  "responseMessage": "Declined by the issuer"
}

### Step 6 - Unknown SPI token: 404 "Transaction not found."
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/confirmations/does-not-exist
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "approved": true
}

### Step 7 - Body without "approved": 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/confirmations/{{spiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{}

### Step 8 - Without X-Api-Key: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/confirmations/{{spiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true
}

### Decrypt an encryptedPayload directly (debugging)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payloads/decrypt
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "encryptedPayload": "{{encryptedPayload}}"
}
